11
00:54:24.754 --> 00:54:28.754
Praise the name of Jesus. Praise the name of Jesus.

12
00:54:28.754 --> 00:54:32.754
He is so good. He is so good.

13
00:54:33.754 --> 00:54:36.754
Hallelujah.

14
00:54:36.754 --> 00:54:39.754
Hallelujah.

15
00:54:39.754 --> 00:54:42.754
Hallelujah.

16
00:55:02.754 --> 00:55:05.754
Hallelujah.

17
00:55:09.754 --> 00:55:12.754
You are so good.

18
00:55:12.754 --> 00:55:17.754
I cannot forget what I have done.

19
00:55:17.754 --> 00:55:20.754
What I have seen.

20
00:55:20.754 --> 00:55:23.754
The goodness of God.

21
00:55:23.754 --> 00:55:25.754
Hallelujah.

22
00:55:25.754 --> 00:55:28.754
Shall we give him a round of applause?

23
00:55:28.754 --> 00:55:31.754
The goodness of God. Hallelujah.

24
00:55:35.754 --> 00:55:38.754
Hallelujah.

25
00:55:38.754 --> 00:55:41.754
Hey dear people, give each other a hug. Say hello for a moment.

26
00:55:41.754 --> 00:55:44.754
Welcome to the church of Jesus Christ.

27
00:55:44.754 --> 00:55:46.754
Get to know each other for a moment.

28
00:55:46.754 --> 00:55:49.754
